  <p className="text-sm md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-700">One of the most persistent myths surrounding legal representation is that it is prohibitively expensive for someone already struggling with debt. When analyzed objectively, however, engaging a qualified advocate is not an expense; it is a highly calculated investment that yields a massive return in the form of debt reduction and legal protection. To understand this, we must examine the comparative costs of the alternatives.</p>
  
